  "cartes.statsLine": "Wins {w} · Losses {l} · Duels {pw}–{pl} · ⚗ {d}",
  "cartes.rulesHtml": "<p><b>Goal</b>: a squad of <b>3 octopus heroes</b> fights the Shell (or another player) on a grid with cover.</p><p><b>Your turn</b>: each hero may <b>move once</b> for free (cyan tiles), then you play up to <b>3 cards</b> (⚡). Each card belongs to a hero: that hero acts. You draw 3 cards per turn and may <b>redraw 1</b> (↻).</p><p><b>Cover</b>: half cover ◒ −25%, full cover ⛨ −45% (and blocks sight) — only on the shooter's side. Shields show on reachable tiles. Melee ignores cover. <b>Ink clouds</b> block line of sight.</p><p><b>Heroism ✸</b>: each attack or skill card played earns some, each takedown too. <b>Heroic ★</b> cards, props and duos spend it.</p><p><b>8 arms = 8 cards</b>: a hero can't hold more cards than arms. A critical hit can <b>sever an arm</b>; it regrows at the infirmary or with some cards.</p><p><b>Hacking 🔌</b>: the Shell can jack into a hero, who then plays against you. An adjacent ally can <b>cut the cable</b> ✂ (1 action). Thermo-optic <b>camo</b> hides a unit and grants an ambush bonus.</p><p><b>Campaign</b>: 8 missions, permadeath (optional), infirmary, recruits. Fallen heroes join the memorial.</p><p><b>Shortcuts</b>: 1-9 cards, Tab next hero, Space end turn, Esc cancel, right-click / long-press: zoom a card.</p>",
