  "cartes.rulesV3": "<h3>What's new in the Lair</h3><p><b>Heroism ✸</b>: attack and skill cards earn it; heroic ★ cards, the environment and duos spend it. <b>Environment</b>: select a hero then tap a barrel 🛢 (explosion), a pylon ⚡ (shock) or a crate 📦 (throw) — it doesn't count as a card play. <b>Knockback</b>: shoving an enemy into a wall, an object or another enemy deals extra damage. <b>Intents</b>: the icon above each enemy shows its next move. <b>Friendship</b>: bonds forged in the Lair unlock combos and duo attacks. <b>Camera</b>: drag to orbit, wheel / pinch to zoom, Q / E to rotate.</p>",
